WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:08.314
"I'll take you to the groupers," Wanda said.

2
00:00:08.315 --> 00:00:10.576
"Grab my fin."

3
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:16.628
"Okay." Cora nodded. "Mo, go to the reef.

4
00:00:16.629 --> 00:00:22.788
Tell the parrot fish help is coming."

5
00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.998
Wanda and Cora swam after the arrow.

6
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:31.388
The water was still thick with sand.

7
00:00:31.389 --> 00:00:36.167
Wanda frowned. "I can't see the arrow."

8
00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:43.132
"Just keep swimming up!" Cora said.

9
00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:49.237
Soon the water got clearer.

10
00:00:49.238 --> 00:00:55.401
"There's the arrow!" Cora shouted.

11
00:00:55.402 --> 00:00:59.515
The arrow shot into shallow water.

12
00:00:59.516 --> 00:01:05.071
Wanda stopped. "It's too shallow for me."

13
00:01:05.072 --> 00:01:08.051
"That's okay," Cora said.

14
00:01:08.052 --> 00:01:12.120
"Go back to the reef. I'll go alone!"

15
00:01:12.121 --> 00:01:18.056
Soon the arrow pointed Cora to some groupers.

16
00:01:18.057 --> 00:01:20.549
Cora thought for a minute.

17
00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.332
Then she remembered something.

18
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:27.525
Groupers were good diggers!

19
00:01:27.526 --> 00:01:33.643
Cora swam closer. "Excuse me . . ."

20
00:01:33.644 --> 00:01:39.403
Cora told the groupers about the parrot fish.

21
00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:43.171
"Can you dig them out?"

22
00:01:43.172 --> 00:01:48.813
"Sorry," one said. "The reef is too deep."

23
00:01:48.814 --> 00:01:53.229
They swam away.

24
00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:58.375
"Now what?" Cora moaned.

25
00:01:58.376 --> 00:02:02.041
Just then another big wave hit.

26
00:02:02.042 --> 00:02:07.629
Cora went tumbling.

27
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:14.381
"Help!" a small voice yelled.

28
00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:17.258
It was a baby grouper.

29
00:02:17.259 --> 00:02:20.856
Waves were tossing him out of the water!

30
00:02:20.857 --> 00:02:27.961
"Hold on, I'll save you!" Cora shouted.

